      "text": "Water: manage stamina and exhaustion. Boss: fill the seal gauge three times. Health is shared between encounters. Leaving an unfinished fight pauses its meters and phases. Reef and Deep water share one underwater ruleset; Deep water overrides pressure and stamina. Underwater boss combines both rulesets: manage exhaustion while breaking three seals.",
